  "ingredients": [
    "cooking spray",
    "8 bone-in, skin-on chicken thighs",
    "0.25 teaspoon garlic salt",
    "0.25 teaspoon onion salt",
    "0.25 teaspoon dried oregano",
    "0.25 teaspoon ground thyme",
    "0.25 teaspoon ground paprika",
    "0.25 teaspoon ground black pepper"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Line a baking sheet with aluminum foil; spray foil with cooking spray.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Arrange chicken thighs, skin-side up, on the prepared baking sheet.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Zm6wXyk43ow1BYcTnmmnbcetM9U=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/235151-CrispyAndTenderBakedChickenThighs-Step1-0680-113b877390ac4a27aae77c9d6aa6c351.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/235151/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine garlic salt, onion salt, oregano, thyme, paprika, and pepper in a small bowl; mix until well combined.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/lpNET-mY9S3ZmsEAGu9npIZ_4Og=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/235151-CrispyAndTenderBakedChickenThighs-Step2-0683-40d391b7217b4baeab84e1dd9257fd38.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/235151/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sprinkle spice mixture liberally over chicken thighs.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/2aZXaxDN1Y-wyqw835B-xEpFKaU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/235151-CrispyAndTenderBakedChickenThighs-Step3-0686-d20aabf197514c4c898c3ca4d36f81c2.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/235151/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake chicken in the preheated oven until skin is crispy, thighs are no longer pink at the bone, and the juices run clear, about 1 hour. An instant-read thermometer inserted near the bone should read 165 degrees F (74 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/09giW6QgqCDrIU8DEWD00jD7kIw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/235151-CrispyAndTenderChickenThighs-Step4-0741-421dbef6187545f1b63686d66d08f771.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/235151/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve hot and enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
